        "title": "JS'de bir JSON",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 148616,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>JS nesnesinin ne olduğunu zaten biliyorsun. Şimdi JSON'un ne olduğunu öğrenelim. JSON, <strong>JavaScript Object Notation</strong> ifadesinin kısaltmasıdır.</p><p>Oyunlarda bu veri biçimini oyuncu istatistikleri, kayıt dosyaları ve bölüm verileri gibi şeyleri depolamak ve paylaşmak için kullanabiliriz.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 148617,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>JSON, normal bir JS nesnesinin <em>string'e dönüştürülmüş</em> bir sürümü gibi görünür.</p><p><code>jsonLevelData</code>'yı normal bir nesne olan <code>{}</code> gibi oluşturabiliriz, ancak tek tırnak <code>'</code> içine alırız.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"22\" endIndex=\"23\" /><option startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"24\" /><option startIndex=\"24\" endIndex=\"25\" /><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"26\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" jsonLevelData = \" /><text value=\"'{}'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>'</code>, ardından <code>{</code> ve sonra <code>}</code>, <code>'</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 148618,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir JSON nesnesi, bir JS nesnesine benzer şekilde anahtar-değer çiftlerinden oluşan bir koleksiyon içerir.</p><p>Ancak JSON içinde anahtarları, burada olduğu gibi tırnak işaretleri arasına almamız gerekir: <code>\"score\"</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"42\" /><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"47\" /><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"48\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" jsonString = \" /><text value=\"'{&quot;player&quot;: &quot;Ranger&quot;, &quot;score&quot;: 200, &quot;alive&quot;: true }'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>\"</code>, ardından <code>score</code> ve son olarak <code>\"</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 148619,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>JSON nesneleri sayılar, diziler, boolean değerleri veya dizeler gibi statik verileri bir araya getirebilir. Ancak içlerinde <strong>fonksiyon</strong> saklayamazlar.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"function(){}\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"60\" endIndex=\"64\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" saveFile = \" /><text value=\"'{&quot;player&quot;: &quot;Ranger&quot;,&quot;score&quot;: 200,&quot;alive&quot;: true}'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>true</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 148620,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aşağıdaki veri türü nedir?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"inventory\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": [\" /><text value=\"&quot;potion&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;sword&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;shield&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"],\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"health\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Bir JS nesnesi</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Bir JSON</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Bir JS nesnesi.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 148621,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>JSON.stringify()</code> metoduyla bir JS nesnesini JSON'a dönüştürebiliriz.</p><p>Burada <code>JSON.stringify(enemy)</code> kullanırsak <code>enemy</code> JS nesnesini JSON dizesine dönüştürebiliriz.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"75\" endIndex=\"79\" /><option startIndex=\"80\" endIndex=\"89\" /><option startIndex=\"90\" endIndex=\"95\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemy = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"type\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Slime&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"hp\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(enemy);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"JSON\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".stringify(enemy));\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>JSON</code>, ardından <code>stringify</code> ve son olarak <code>enemy</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 148622,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir JSON dizesini <code>JSON.parse()</code> metoduyla bir JS nesnesine de dönüştürebiliriz.</p><p>Parantezlerin içine <code>playerSave</code> eklersek JSON dizesini bir JS nesnesine dönüştürürüz.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"60\" endIndex=\"64\" /><option startIndex=\"65\" endIndex=\"70\" /><option startIndex=\"71\" endIndex=\"81\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerSave = \" /><text value=\"'{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Nova&quot;,&quot;level&quot;:3}'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"JSON\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".parse(playerSave));\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>JSON</code>, ardından <code>parse</code> ve son olarak <code>playerSave</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 148623,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir JS nesnesini JSON dizesine nasıl dönüştürebiliriz?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>JSON.stringify</code> ile</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>JSON.parse</code> ile</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>JSON.stringify</code> ile.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 148624,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Konsol ne görüntüleyecek?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" gameState = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"score\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"13\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"paused\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"JSON\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".stringify(gameState));\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>{\"score\": 13, \"paused\": false}</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>{score: 13, paused : false}</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>{\"score\": 13, \"paused\": false}</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 148625,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aşağıdaki JSON'u tamamla.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"19\" /><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"21\" /><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"26\" /><option startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"57\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" levelInfo = \" /><text value=\"'{&quot;name&quot;: &quot;Forest-1&quot;, &quot;enemies&quot;: 123 }'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>'</code>, ardından <code>\"</code> ve sonra <code>\"</code>, <code>'</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 148626,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>*<em>Ayrıştır</em><code>saveData</code> JSON dizesini, konsol çıktısında bir JS nesnesi görecek şekilde.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"88\" endIndex=\"93\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" saveData = \" /><text value=\"'{&quot;player&quot;: &quot;Nova&quot;, &quot;checkpoint&quot;:&quot;Cave&quot;}'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" parsedSaveData = \" /><text value=\"JSON\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".parse(saveData);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(parsedSaveData);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>parse</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          }
        ]
